n:0 0 28px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:28px;margin-left:0">Hello Fixture Member, explore the latest WTIA news, programmes and opportunities selected for our member community.</p><a href="https://www.hkwtia.org/portal" style="line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:#2563eb;border-radius:8px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;padding:12px 20px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:20px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:500%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px">Read the update</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:500%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" aria-label="Marketing email preferences"><tbody><tr><td><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;border-color:#e5e7eb;margin:32px 0 20px"/><p class="email-muted" style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6b7280;margin:0 0 8px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">You are receiving this marketing email because you opted in to WTIA updates.</p><p class="email-muted" style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6b7280;margin:0 0 8px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">4/F, KOHO, 73-75 Hung To Road, Kwun Tong, Hong Kong</p><a class="email-link" href="https://www.hkwtia.org/api/unsubscribe?token=signed-fixture" style="color:#2563eb;text-decoration-line:none;font-size:12px;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Unsubscribe from marketing email</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
